The '''Spinnaker Trail''' was a trail on the [[planet]] [[Vandor]] near the [[Corubalni Pass]], [[Mount Vastadon]], and [[Mount Redolava]]. Markers were used on the trail to guide travelers along safe routes and as memorials to recognize those who [[Death|perished]] on making the trails.<ref name="Official Guide" />

